From: meysam82003 <meysamsalamatnasab@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 07:26:29 +0330
Subject: [PATCH] feat(store): open store web pages in an embedded browser mode

- StoreEmbeddedPolicy: single https launch gate limited to the store
  host; navigation guard keeps redirects on the origin (subdomains and
  known store hosts allowed, everything else blocked)
- STORE_EMBEDDED chrome: address bar, tab counter, video handoff, bottom
  bar, downloads, bookmarks, share URL and open-external are all hidden
  or refused; the page title is shown instead of any raw URL
- StoreLinkRouter.browserIntent now routes Terms/Help/Panel/Support
  through the embedded mode; payment keeps flowing to
  SecurePaymentActivity untouched
